<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sappi details capitalisation share award.</title>
<headline>Sappi details capitalisation share award.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sappi Ltd said on Friday, in terms of a capitalisation share award, shareholders would receive new shares in the ratio of 1.77 new ordinary shares for every 100 held on January 10.</p>
<p>Each new share would carry an issue price of 39.50 rand.</p>
<p>Shareholders may decline the award and instead elect to receive a cash dividend of 70 cents a share, Sappi said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
